WEBVTT

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.790
Hurry up!

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:07.000
If we don't hurry, then we won't be able to see
Prince Nedilus and Princess Fal!

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.170
Oh! Wait for me!

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.790
As long I have a queen, then I will finally be able
to ascend the throne as King.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:21.040
I will be able to rule over this country
both in name and in reality.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.040
In addition, as long as I have the sacred sword,

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.880
I can exploit the demonkind
and take Meigis, let alone...

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:30.460
Princess Fal!

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.250
So beautiful.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.380
You are the finest bride...

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:40.670
Thank you...

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.290
Now then, let's go to where everyone is.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:46.750
Please excuse me...

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.750
Please go on ahead of me.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.290
I will follow soon.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.170
There are probably various preparations
a woman has to do.

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:59.580
Please do not keep me waiting
for too long, Princess Fal...

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:03.580
You may go now too...

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:05.420
Yes ma'am...

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:15.710
If there is a man you would like to marry,

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:19.580
then regardless of such things as social class,
you should marry that person.

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.500
Because your happiness comes first, Fal...

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:29.670
I am the princess of the country of Meigis...

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:32.170
This is for the sake of the country...

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:35.960
This is what's good, right?

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:38.920
Al-kun...

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.500
Yeah! I'm looking forward to this.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:16.040
<b>The Farmer and the Wedding</b>

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.290
I wonder how she'll look... So much to see...

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:20.250
Although it's the back gate,
I'm surprised we were able to sneak in.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:23.210
With the wedding, the whole of the country
is involved in the merrymaking.

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:26.750
In any case, we have to sneak
into the palace where the hostage is.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:27.880
Here goes!

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:28.380
Likewise!

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:29.250
Quickly!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:31.630
Over there, huh?

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:35.040
As expected, it seems like
they're keeping a strict watch on.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.250
Don't worry!

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.580
If it's this disguise, then we won't be found out!

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:42.000
After all, I'd requested this from Meigis' best tailor!

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:44.920
Just because it was tailored doesn't mean...

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:46.920
These outfits are...

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:48.130
They're good, huh?

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.540
Any way you look at it, we're farmers!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.920
This is an undercover operation, right?

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.290
On the contrary, I think we're going
to stand out, you know?

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:56.630
No need to worry!

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.880
No, rather than worry,
there's nothing but anxiety!

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:01.920
So, what's the plan?

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.540
It's perfect, of course!

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:08.250
First of all, we'll go save Gazelle's sweetheart,
who's being imprisoned in the castle.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:11.040
And then, we'll take her to the church.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.290
And then, we'll have Gazelle,
who's being threatened by Nedilus,

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:16.670
confess that "the power of the sword is fake!"

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.420
With this, it'll be all settled.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:21.040
That's being simplistic...

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:24.540
We won't be found out.
After all, I am a genuine farmer...

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:26.750
Hey! What're you all doing?!

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:30.080
Oh no! We got suspected right away!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.670
We are not suspicious people!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.710
We are just farmers!

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:37.960
We came to deliver fresh vegetables, that's all!

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.960
Wh-where are you delivering them?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.000
To the palace!

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.790
Why vegetables, to the palace?

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:44.080
Because they're fresh!

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:45.330
Hey, c'mon...

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.540
I knew it...

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:47.710
Perfect!

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:54.330
They're suspicious people!
They're suspicious people masquerading as farmers!

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:57.790
Why are we being chased?!
There aren't any bad guys among farmers!

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:01.080
You know, the set-up of a farmer
in the palace was implausible!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:04.670
In any case, we gotta sneak into the
palace where the hostage is!

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:06.580
"Sneak in," in this situation?!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:07.880
There's no time!

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.960
Leave this to us!

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.250
Al-kun, you head to the hostage!

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.130
Okay! Hang on, what're you...?!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.330
Sneaking in; successful!
We're leaving the rest to you, Al-kun!

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:22.630
Wow...

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:25.880
Helen-san is the one person
I shouldn't go up against...

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:36.290
Can't get out...

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:42.750
My apologies, are you hurt?

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:44.630
Wh-what about you?!

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:45.630
Are...

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:49.380
Are you Gazelle's sweetheart?

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:51.130
You know Gazelle?!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.130
What was that noise just now?!

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:56.040
Who the hell are you?!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:58.750
I am...

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.830
I am...

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:05.290
a farmer!

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:15.540
Good harvest!

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:18.630
Now then...

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:21.210
Once again, Gazelle's sweetheart...

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:22.290
Yes.

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:23.630
Please come with me.

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:26.960
Gazelle is being exploited by this country!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:30.210
I am going to expose
this country's evil deeds starting now!

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.580
Gazelle is...

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.460
Understood.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.130
All right! Let's go!

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:37.170
Okay!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.380
Gazelle's sweetheart?!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:42.000
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.330
I would very much like to go, but...

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:47.250
What?! How despicable!

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:52.670
We pretty much succeeded in escaping, I think!

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.210
To the church as is!

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:00.710
Run away! Run away! Run away!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.420
Hang on! Al-kun?!

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:03.170
Hey!

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:05.880
I successfully rescued Gazelle's sweetheart!

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.500
As expected of you, Al-kun!

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.420
Although she's fainted.

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:12.250
Well, more importantly...

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:13.540
Run away!

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:19.710
This bell is...

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.130
It looks like the church is over there.

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.630
We gotta hurry or the ceremony will start!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.250
Fal...

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:27.670
Al-kun.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:31.670
In regard to Fal-sama, no matter what it takes,
please protect her!

00:07:31.670 --> 00:07:34.380
We'll somehow take care of things here, so...

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:37.210
Helen-san... Ruri...

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.710
The farmer look looks good on you!

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:41.170
That doesn't make us happy!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:42.380
Well, I'm counting on you!

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:43.710
If it's Al-kun...

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.170
For sure!

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.960
This is about time where I come in.

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:01.460
Fal... Are you really sure?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.920
If it's right now, in my name as King,
I can still call off the ceremony...

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.170
It's fine...

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.960
This is something I decided by myself.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.170
And also...

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.500
this is for Meigis, right?

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:15.500
I'm sorry...

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.630
Run away constructively!

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:30.290
That's the diversionary tactic!

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:32.460
Al-kun, please make it in time!

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:33.790
Otherwise...

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:37.540
Our efforts will be wasted too!

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:41.580
In times of sickness and in health...

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.540
For richer, for poorer...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.830
Until death do you part...

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.460
As long as your lives continue...

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:54.460
Do you promise to be faithful to your husband?

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.420
I do...

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:02.380
You may now kiss the bride...

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:13.080
With this, you are mine now.
Please put your mind at ease.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:17.130
I will show you that I can relieve
all of your distress...

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:23.960
I don't want to...

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:27.830
After all...

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.080
I don't want to!

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:34.000
Al-kun!

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:38.830
Ow!

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:42.500
The door!

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:45.460
What?!

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:58.330
Hey, Fal!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.960
Al... kun...?

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:10.210
Oops! When I knocked, the door flew off...

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.920
I guess I'm late.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:18.130
Nope!

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:23.290
Al! I see, you're that bastard!

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:24.250
Oh, you woke up!

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:27.380
This is the villain who came
to kidnap the princess!

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:29.000
Restrain him immediately!

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:32.500
You're the one who's the villain... Nedilus.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.750
What?!

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:38.000
You have that sword, Læva...
Whatever it's called...

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:40.500
That's a fake, isn't it?

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.580
What did he say?! He's lying!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.500
That can't be... A fake...?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.540
What a funny joke!

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:58.630
Your ulterior motive must be to throw the place
into confusion and ruin the wedding...

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.580
You should tell a better lie than that.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.130
Al...

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:06.040
Unfortunately,

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:09.250
I saw that sword disperse the monsters.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:11.790
That is a genuine sacred sword...

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.080
That's right!

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:16.670
All the people here know the power of the sword.

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.790
They'll all turn a deaf ear
to the likes of your nonsense!

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:26.290
Or... Can you prove it?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:27.830
I can.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.500
Huh?!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.500
Prince Nedilus!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.080
A-all over the country...

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:35.580
there's a massive number of...

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:36.880
monsters!

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:39.330
What?!

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:48.920
Summoning about this much will do, I think...

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:52.380
I'll leave the rest to you...

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.210
Wh-why are there monsters, here of all places?!

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.670
We're surrounded!

00:11:57.670 --> 00:12:01.130
Don't worry! We have the sacred sword, right?!

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:03.330
Prince Nedilus!

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.790
Please use the sacred sword
and drive them off at once!

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:07.460
Y-yeah...

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.380
Come on, hurry!

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:13.960
Gazelle! Where are you?! Bring the sword at-

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:15.750
Huh?!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.670
Gazelle... I'm so glad you're okay...

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.580
I'm sorry I put you through a tough time...

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:25.460
Why is that woman here?!

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:27.750
You know, this was surprisingly light!

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:32.750
Since Gazelle-san is in the middle of something,
I've brought it instead.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:34.500
Here you are!

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.210
Your Highness! Hurry!

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:42.500
Prince Nedilus!

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:43.250
Come on, hurry!

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:44.170
What are you doing?!

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:45.630
Your Highness!

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:47.040
Prince!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:50.130
Your Highness!

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:51.170
Please save us!

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:51.670
Your Highness!

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:52.750
Don't force yourself...

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.040
You can't use this, can you?
Since it's a fake...

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.210
You bastard, what are you...?!

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.290
How rude!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.580
Who the hell are you?!

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:01.040
Well, just you wait and see!

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:09.290
With one blow from the monster,
the sacred sword has...

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:11.670
So, was that sword a fake?!

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:15.460
What's the meaning of this?!
What were the monsters dispersed by?!

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:16.750
He planned and staged it himself!

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.380
They're retreating...

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:24.540
Prince Nedilus...

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:29.500
threatened me and ordered me
to send in monsters to various countries.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:32.330
And then, for the monsters that were sent...

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:36.130
I had them withdraw when the signal was given
by the soldiers raising their swords.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:41.290
I controlled the demonkind with this flute
that can only be played by a demon...

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.540
In other words...

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.880
it is not by the power of a sacred sword!

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:50.420
Prince Nedilus, do you have an explanation?

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:55.750
Huh?!

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:58.960
You're too late in realizing it, King Galan!

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.540
Your country is already done for!

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:02.380
Huh?!

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:03.750
What does that mean?!

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.290
During last night...

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:08.790
I sent in a large swarm of monsters to Meigis!

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:12.040
A royal capital without a king
or princess is powerless!

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:13.210
Impossible!

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:14.670
I didn't send an instruction like that...

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:15.960
So naïve!

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:20.170
If it's just to lure monsters in,
then I don't need a flute!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.080
If you scatter around
some monster carcasses,

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:24.040
they'll freely come swarming
in by themselves!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:29.460
After Meigis falls by the monsters,
I had planned on making it part of my territory, but...

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:30.580
Why, you...?!

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:32.380
Hurry and get reinforcements to the country!

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:34.880
Too late! No matter what you do now-

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:37.460
Meigis will not fall!

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.500
Helen-san! Ruri!

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:45.790
After Meigis was attacked, I was asked by the soldiers
and the adventurers of the guild!

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.710
They asked me to retrain them!

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:51.540
Because they wanted to protect their own country
with their own hands!

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:54.170
Please believe them! In Meigis!

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:57.080
We're not letting anyone lay a hand on Meigis!

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:58.920
Suppress! Suppress!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:01.040
Let's do this!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.960
Don't falter!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:06.500
Absolutely protect the royal capital to the end!

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:07.960
Yeah!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:10.290
The people of the country...

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:14.460
As king, I am a fortunate person!

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:16.250
Everyone...

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:17.540
That's why, Fal...

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:22.880
You don't need to sacrifice yourself.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.130
Al-kun!

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:29.580
Yes! Hey, soldiers!

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:34.330
Restrain every last one of these bastards
who are desecrating this country!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.080
Huh?! Wait! Wh-what the...

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.460
Do as I, your king, says!

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:41.380
Hey!

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:44.580
While we were running away,
we told them about all of your evil deeds!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.880
The soldiers understood us.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.880
Yay!

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:52.380
You good-for-nothings!

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.130
Dammit!

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:57.380
Father!

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:00.080
Huh?

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:05.330
No one will obey you anymore!

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:11.880
It's over, Prince Nedilus!

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:16.040
No way... It was supposed to be a perfect plan...

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:24.580
What a relief... I guess it's finally all settled.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.460
Al-kun!

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:28.000
Thank you!

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:33.920
I do love you, after all!

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.460
Fal?!

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:41.670
Hang on a sec!

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:43.250
Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.330
Al-kun, are you acquainted with the princess?!

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:47.000
What's your relationship to her?!

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:50.040
Well, we're just acquaintances, so to speak...

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:53.630
I don't think something like this is a good thing,
since you're not even going out together!

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:55.960
You know, even if she's the princess,
this is unacceptable!

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:56.960
C'mon, Al-kun!

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:58.920
Y-yeah, you're right.

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:02.130
All right, Fal, let's have you
let go for the moment, okay?

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:03.500
I don't want to let go...

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:04.380
Fal!

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:07.080
Al, you idiot! You womanizer!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.210
Why am I the one getting reviled?!

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.630
Oh, Your Majesty.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.460
This is... This isn't what it looks like!

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:14.630
There's nothing between us...

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:15.670
Thank you.

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:16.460
Huh?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.920
This is now the second time you've saved me.

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:22.210
It is necessary that I should tell you this formally!

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:23.210
What?

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:25.330
Congratulations on marrying
and taking on our family name!

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:26.460
Welcome!

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:28.380
Oh, no, no! I definitely will not go to the palace!

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.210
Welcome! Welcome!
Oh, no, no! I definitely will not go to the palace!<b></b>

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:31.710
What?!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:33.630
What's up with that official approval from the King?!

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.250
I'm telling you it's a misunderstanding!

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.880
Fal! Please let go!

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.290
No!

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.330
King Galan.

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:43.670
For you...

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:46.250
What is it?

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:51.210
It is a letter from an unknown sender
that was sent to Nedilus.

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:55.290
Everything from this plan was written in it,
which we obtained.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.000
"Everything from this plan"?

00:17:58.330 --> 00:17:59.630
"We"...?

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:01.330
I see!

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.710
You are a Shadow Puppet?!

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.710
Yes sir.

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:09.500
It appears there was someone manipulating
Nedilus' plan behind-the-scenes.  

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.880
Are you saying there's a
mastermind behind-the-scenes?

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:14.210
This incident...

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:17.250
There appears to be something that even
we have not been able to grasp.

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:20.580
We intend to continue the investigation
from here on as well, but...

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:21.960
Please be careful.

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:23.960
Yes, understood.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.290
And then a few days later...

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.380
Nedilus was imprisoned...

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:34.040
and peace was restored to Meigis.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:37.040
Oh? Al, it's you!

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:39.750
I hear that you saved the princess this time?!

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:43.040
It sounds like all of you were hugely successful too.

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:46.250
Al! You are the pride of our guild!

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:48.750
Thanks to you, the requests are flooding in!

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:50.710
Please take on the quests non-stop!

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:53.750
But I want to work as a farmer!

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:54.830
Hey, look!

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:56.210
No way!

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:56.960
Huh?!

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.210
It's the Princess!

00:18:58.380 --> 00:18:59.380
The Princess?!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.170
Your Highness!

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:02.380
Good day.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.130
Princess Fal?!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:05.790
Fal?!

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:11.130
I deeply appreciate the action
done by the guild this time.

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:13.290
This is a reward from the palace.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:14.790
Whoa!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.460
Hang on, everyone! I'll split it fairly...

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.040
First come, first served!
Hang on, everyone! I'll split it fairly...<b></b>

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.290
I said to wait!

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.670
I gotta pay off my tabs!

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:22.920
Hey! You gotta wait!

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.540
That's not fair! Hey!

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:29.290
You know, I don't feel like this is
the first time I've met the Princess...

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:31.170
Have I met her somewhere?

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:34.790
What's wrong, Al-kun?
You're spitting out way too much...

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:39.460
No, she's got that common look
that you can find pretty much anywhere, right?

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.290
I think so too!

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.790
What?! A beauty like her?!

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:46.500
Really! She's not like that much of a beauty...

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.750
I'm sorry I'm not a beauty...

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:49.460
What?!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.710
But we were talking about the Princess...

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.500
Oh, right...

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:00.960
It's Ruri, right?

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:05.000
Just letting you know,
but the princess isn't your only rival.

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:06.330
I know that!

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.960
I'll never accept you or Princess Fal!

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:12.040
There'll be no unfair beating to the punch, okay?

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:13.670
Of course!

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:17.710
Let us play fair here, woman-to-woman.  

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:24.380
Now then, I'm going to go work in the fields...

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.960
Have I met her somewhere?

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:37.290
The tomatas made with nigari are the best, after all.

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:38.580
So, Al!

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:39.540
Yeah...

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:42.130
Given this circumstance...

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.170
...we want you to make it clear, so...

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:48.000
Who is it that you like?!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:48.750
Ta-da!

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:50.500
These are huge!

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:51.630
Oh! These too!

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:52.460
Al-kun!

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:54.250
The way you're trying to evade is sloppy!

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:58.540
Al-kun, you went out of your way and came all the way
to the neighboring country for my sake, right?!

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:00.540
In the end, yeah, I guess so.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:03.380
You risked your life to save me, right?!

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:05.130
Well, that's true too.

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:06.880
Tomatas, tomatas...

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:08.790
Potatas, potatas...

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:09.880
What a weak response!
Potatas, potatas...<b></b>

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.710
We lost to vegetables?!

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:16.880
By any chance, Al, is there another woman
besides us who you have feelings for?!

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.290
No way. Al-kun, of all people, wouldn't have...

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:20.420
A woman?

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:21.710
Yeah...

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:23.210
there is.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:24.250
What?

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:27.040
What?!

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:28.540
Now then...

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:31.000
I'm going to deliver goods now for today.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:33.290
So, sorry, but maybe next time!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.420
A woman...?

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:39.920
No way!

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:43.710
Here you go...

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:47.040
I was able to pick a lot of vegetables today too...

00:21:49.420 --> 00:21:50.580
Ilvia...

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:40.960
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:40.960
<b>Al's Past</b>
